      "essence": "Responsive allegiance without loss of integrity gives Following a path beyond force, passivity, or premature certainty.",
      "summary": "The Daoist lens attends to how force can accord with the configuration instead of contending with it. In Following, the central situation is adaptation through following what is timely and sound, and the commentarial evidence repeatedly emphasizes following, others, and represents. The main danger is compliance replacing discernment, especially when partial conditions are mistaken for permission to press ahead. Its constructive capacity is responsive allegiance without loss of integrity, expressed through attention to sequence, relation, and the limits of the present position. Transformation comes through responsive timing: capacity remains available because it is neither suppressed nor spent against the grain.",
