      "summary": "The Confucian lens places the configuration within cultivated conduct, position, and responsibility. In Following, the central situation is adaptation through following what is timely and sound, and the commentarial evidence repeatedly emphasizes following, correct, and fault. The main danger is compliance replacing discernment, especially when partial conditions are mistaken for permission to press ahead. Its constructive capacity is responsive allegiance without loss of integrity, expressed through attention to sequence, relation, and the limits of the present position. Development therefore joins inward steadiness with outward appropriateness, making character visible through conduct suited to the moment.",
